  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## Rain Check 2: OK / CALL reply handling\nPoint your Twilio number's incoming-message webhook here. OK confirms the new date, CALL flags the job so you phone the customer, anything else is forwarded to you.\n\n**Setup**\n1. In Twilio, set your number's \"A message comes in\" webhook (HTTP POST) to this workflow's Production URL.\n2. Create a Google Sheet with a tab named Schedule using the header row in sheet-templates/Schedule.csv; paste its ID into the Config node (sheetId).\n3. In Config set your business name, owner email, channel (sms or email), the weekdays you work (workDays) and, only if you use workflow 3, your weather location and key.\n4. Attach credentials on nodes with a warning icon: Google Sheets OAuth2, SMTP, and Twilio (HTTP Basic Auth) if you use SMS.\n5. Dates are YYYY-MM-DD (format the day / new_day columns as plain text). Run with test rows (your own phone or email) before activating.",
    "height": 300,
    "width": 420
   },
